[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 16740.789, "timestamp": "04:39:00", "text": "全て。それほどひどい状況だ。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16743.59, "timestamp": "04:39:03", "text": "だって、2歳くらいの時に遊んでたのを覚えてるから"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 16744.797, "timestamp": "04:39:04", "author": "@kaiguyniki", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/f9aZERpOc1bv1JDUl12ZTXeQ7j1KdXBflkbl-6qlBLzM-hbbEQKWUlPpcJJxTU-qSUwNxrez=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "you'll be on 10fps soon"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16747.109, "timestamp": "04:39:07", "text": "数日前からフレームが見つかっていません"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16749.75, "timestamp": "04:39:09", "text": "20まで行くように言われたけど、私は行った。でも私は遊んでいた"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16751.99, "timestamp": "04:39:11", "text": "私自身のライバルたち。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16756.31, "timestamp": "04:39:16", "text": "何てことだ。もうすぐ10FPSになるよ。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16758.23, "timestamp": "04:39:18", "text": "ああ、10まで到達することについては心配しないでください。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16761.429, "timestamp": "04:39:21", "text": "それはもうすぐ来る。知っている。今シーズン 2.5"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16763.75, "timestamp": "04:39:23", "text": "私は10番にいます。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16765.51, "timestamp": "04:39:25", "text": "それ。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16767.869, "timestamp": "04:39:27", "text": "私は"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16770.629, "timestamp": "04:39:30", "text": "10 か、もっと悪いことに、私は"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16773.349, "timestamp": "04:39:33", "text": "ゲームをプレイするかどうかわからないので"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16775.99, "timestamp": "04:39:35", "text": "人々がそのゲームをどのようにプレイするか。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16778.948, "timestamp": "04:39:38", "text": "だからあなたはお金を使って"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16780.55, "timestamp": "04:39:40", "text": "ゲーム。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16783.75, "timestamp": "04:39:43", "text": "いいえ、していません。シーズンを買うのを見ました"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16786.788, "timestamp": "04:39:46", "text": "あの女の学校の女性。わかった、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16790.15, "times